@startuml FRQ-PRC-15.22-document-activity
' Activity dijagram: RADNJE i OBJEKTNI TOK — što se s dokumentom događa i u kojem
' je stanju između radnji. Nema potpisa metoda, asercija ni audit zapisa: tko koga
' zove nosi sequence dijagram, ne ovaj.
' PlantUML activity sintaksa nema notaciju objektnog čvora, pa su objektni čvorovi
' prikazani kao obojene radnje s imenom objekta i stanjem u uglatim zagradama.
' Gledište: analiza. Publika: arhitekt, tester.
' Prikaz, ne izvor istine (D-13).
title FRQ-PRC-15.22 — Activity: one unit becomes a stored document

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #555555
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

|#F5F7FA|Processor|
start
:Discover a unit of work;
#EDE7F6:**unit descriptor**\n[selected];
if (within name, date and order criteria?) then (no)
  :Discard the unit;
  end
else (yes)
endif

|#F2FBF4|Create strategy|
:Construct the document
for this subject;
:Stamp its origin;
#EDE7F6:**document**\n[described];
note right
  Described, not read: the document
  carries a manifest of the subject,
  not its bytes.
end note

|#FFF4E6|Pipeline|
repeat
  :Extract content
  from the subject;
  :Enrich the document;
  #EDE7F6:**document**\n[enriched];
repeat while (another transformation?) is (yes)
->no;

|#EEF4FF|Blackboard|
:Hold the document
on the canvas;
if (flush boundary reached?) then (no)
  :Carry to the next boundary;
  end
else (yes)
endif

repeat :Take the next destination;

|#F2FBF4|Write strategy|
  if (the document is this destination's subject?) then (no)
    :Decline the destination;
  else (yes)
    :Render the payload
    in the destination's format;
    #EDE7F6:**payload**\n[rendered];
    :Compose the output name;

|#FFEBEE|Driver|
    :Store the payload;
    #EDE7F6:**payload**\n[stored];

|#F2FBF4|Write strategy|
    :Record where it landed;
    #EDE7F6:**document**\n[stored];
  endif

|#EEF4FF|Blackboard|
repeat while (another destination?) is (yes)
->no;
:Release the canvas;

|#F5F7FA|Processor|
stop

@enduml
